pistor (1.1.3) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Turn the fan off and keep it off when the service stops: handle
    SIGTERM/SIGINT/SIGHUP, run SERVICE in the main thread, and leave the
    fan PWM line driven low on exit instead of letting gpiozero release it
    to an input, which runs 4-pin fans at full speed.

 -- Jeff Curless <jeff@thecurlesses.com>  Mon, 23 Nov 2026 21:27:48 -0500

